{"id":67459,"date":"2025-08-29T08:24:37","date_gmt":"2025-08-29T07:24:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=67459"},"modified":"2026-10-01T22:50:19","modified_gmt":"2026-10-01T21:50:19","slug":"extremo-sul-ultramarathon","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/extremo-sul-ultramarathon\/","title":{"rendered":"Extremo Sul Ultramarathon 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Extremo Sul Ultramarathon 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Extremo Sul Ultramarathon 2026<\/strong> (A Maior Praia do Mundo) \u00e9 uma das travessias a p\u00e9 de endurance mais extremas do planeta, realizando-se de <strong>20 a 22 de novembro de 2026<\/strong> ao longo da costa atl\u00e2ntica do <strong>Rio Grande do Sul<\/strong>, no <strong>Brasil<\/strong>. Em regime non-stop com tempo limite de 52 horas, a prova desafia os atletas a percorrerem <strong>226 km<\/strong> cont\u00ednuos de orla mar\u00edtima entre a <strong>Barra do Chu\u00ed<\/strong> e a hist\u00f3rica <strong>Praia do Cassino<\/strong>, enfrentando areia fofa, mar\u00e9s vivas, ventos constantes e o isolamento total da natureza.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela prestigiada <strong>Horizontes Turismo de Natureza<\/strong> e com inscri\u00e7\u00f5es limitadas a apenas 100 participantes sob rigoroso crit\u00e9rio de qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o (m\u00ednimo de uma ultramaratona de 100 km conclu\u00edda desde 2024), a prova integra a chancela <strong>TOR Experience<\/strong>, garantindo acesso direto ao Tor des G\u00e9ants para os primeiros 10 finalistas da classifica\u00e7\u00e3o geral. O evento disp\u00f5e de bases de apoio espa\u00e7adas, transporte de drop bags, monitoriza\u00e7\u00e3o por geolocalizador por sat\u00e9lite e apoio m\u00e9dico integral.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">20 a 22 de novembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Barra do Chu\u00ed, Rio Grande do Sul, Brasil<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Ultramaratona 226 km e 100 km<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Horizontes Turismo de Natureza<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">52 horas<\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Running<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Extremo Sul Ultramarathon 226K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 20 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 18:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Early Bird (20 vagas):<\/strong> R$ 2.250<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Esgotar lote)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Lote 2:<\/strong> R$ 2.330<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Esgotar lote)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Lote 3:<\/strong> R$ 2.420<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Esgotar lote)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Lote 4:<\/strong> R$ 2.510<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Esgotar lote)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Lote 5:<\/strong> R$ 2.600<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (31\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Running<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Extremo Sul Ultramarathon 100K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 20 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 18:00<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o trajeto da Extremo Sul Ultramarathon 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A travessia decorre de 20 a 22 de novembro de 2026, com partida marcada para as 18:00 na Barra do Chu\u00ed e chegada consagrada na Praia do Cassino, no Rio Grande do Sul, Brasil.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia oficial e o tempo limite para conclus\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova rainha tem a extens\u00e3o de 226 km cont\u00ednuos pela praia em regime non-stop, com um tempo limite m\u00e1ximo de 52 horas para classifica\u00e7\u00e3o oficial.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pr\u00e9-requisitos desportivos para participar?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Para validar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o, o atleta deve comprovar a conclus\u00e3o de pelo menos uma corrida oficial de 100 km ou superior realizada a partir de 2024, al\u00e9m de atestado m\u00e9dico espec\u00edfico.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A prova atribui qualifica\u00e7\u00f5es para competi\u00e7\u00f5es internacionais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim. Gra\u00e7as \u00e0 parceria TOR Experience, os primeiros 10 atletas classificados na geral da prova de 226 km recebem entrada direta sem sorteio para o m\u00edtico Tor des G\u00e9ants.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona o apoio log\u00edstico e as bases ao longo dos 226 km?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza bases de apoio com alimenta\u00e7\u00e3o s\u00f3lida, hidrata\u00e7\u00e3o, descanso, assist\u00eancia m\u00e9dica e transporte de dois sacos de transi\u00e7\u00e3o (drop bags), com rastreamento GPS obrigat\u00f3rio.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Extremo Sul Ultramarathon 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-20\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Chu\u00ed, Rio Grande do Sul, Brasil\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Brasil\", \"addressRegion\": \"Brasil\", \"addressCountry\": \"BR\"}}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e o trajeto da Extremo Sul Ultramarathon 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A travessia decorre de 20 a 22 de novembro de 2026, com partida marcada para as 18:00 na Barra do Chu\u00ed e chegada consagrada na Praia do Cassino, no Rio Grande do Sul, Brasil.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia oficial e o tempo limite para conclus\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova rainha tem a extens\u00e3o de 226 km cont\u00ednuos pela praia em regime non-stop, com um tempo limite m\u00e1ximo de 52 horas para classifica\u00e7\u00e3o oficial.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pr\u00e9-requisitos desportivos para participar?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Para validar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o, o atleta deve comprovar a conclus\u00e3o de pelo menos uma corrida oficial de 100 km ou superior realizada a partir de 2024, al\u00e9m de atestado m\u00e9dico espec\u00edfico.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"A prova atribui qualifica\u00e7\u00f5es para competi\u00e7\u00f5es internacionais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim. Gra\u00e7as \u00e0 parceria TOR Experience, os primeiros 10 atletas classificados na geral da prova de 226 km recebem entrada direta sem sorteio para o m\u00edtico Tor des G\u00e9ants.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funciona o apoio log\u00edstico e as bases ao longo dos 226 km?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza bases de apoio com alimenta\u00e7\u00e3o s\u00f3lida, hidrata\u00e7\u00e3o, descanso, assist\u00eancia m\u00e9dica e transporte de dois sacos de transi\u00e7\u00e3o (drop bags), com rastreamento GPS obrigat\u00f3rio.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":68434,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[22,622,499],"event_type_2":[1069,1530],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-67459","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-chui-rio-grande-do-sul-brasil","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-endurance","event_type-trail-ultra","event_type_2-america","event_type_2-brasil"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/cartaz-extremo-sul-ultramarathon-1.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/67459","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=67459"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/67459\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":69098,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/67459\/revisions\/69098"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\